// for every x, x^2 mod 4, cases
claim: for every x in Z, x^2 == 0 mod 4 or x^2 == 1 mod 4.
proof
case 1 x is even: write x = 2k. then x^2 = 4k^2 == 0 mod 4.
case 2 x is odd: write x = 2k + 1. then x^2 = 4(k^2 + k) + 1 == 1 mod 4.
qed
corollary: no integer of the form 4m + 3 is a sum of two squares.
